--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data

Vehicle identification data may be retrieved at runtime from the U.S. National
Highway Traffic Safety Administration (NHTSA) Product Information Catalog and
Vehicle Listing (vPIC) API. That data is not covered by this notice; see
docs/DATA-SOURCES.md for attribution and terms.

